    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMPY BUNNY is a 3D precision platform game in which you jump in an annoying way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the journey of a silly bunny who must reach the top of the burrow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game features...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a silly jumping creature </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover accessories to put on your rabbit as if it were a doll </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large burrow to explore and complete</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold to jump higher and glide consuming energy. You will find more energy through the level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As there are no checkpoints, you will have to be careful not to waste your energy or be brave and face the challenges without needing it... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Wait... do people really care about this in these kinds of games?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Hmm, whatever, let's say enough to fill this section with content.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fearless Bunny faces an intense journey searching for the true reason to exist in a world full of bad vibes. In a post-apocalyptic world where carrots eradicate humanity, and you are the only hope for... the world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Well, I guess that's enough, isn't it?<br>-You maybe don't need to expect too much of this game -.-</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMPY BUNNY is a 3D precision platform game in which you jump in an annoying way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the journey of a silly bunny who must reach the top of the burrow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game features...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a silly jumping creature </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover accessories to put on your rabbit as if it were a doll </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large burrow to explore and complete</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold to jump higher and glide consuming energy. You will find more energy through the level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As there are no checkpoints, you will have to be careful not to waste your energy or be brave and face the challenges without needing it... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Wait... do people really care about this in these kinds of games?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Hmm, whatever, let's say enough to fill this section with content.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fearless Bunny faces an intense journey searching for the true reason to exist in a world full of bad vibes. In a post-apocalyptic world where carrots eradicate humanity, and you are the only hope for... the world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Well, I guess that's enough, isn't it?<br>-You maybe don't need to expect too much of this game -.-</i></p>",
